<title>UK: Ladbroke firms on press report.</title>
<headline>Ladbroke firms on press report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Ladbroke Plc extended recent gains on Friday after a press report heightened hopes for a bid from Hilton Hotels Corp, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 1021 GMT, the shares were up 5p to 241p.  </p>
<p>The Financial Times' Lex Column said the company, which has long been the subject of bid rumours, could receive a full bid from Hilton.</p>
<p>Talk that brokerage BZW repeated its &quot;buy&quot; rating on the shares also supported the market. BZW was targeting the the 265p level, even in the absence of a bid from Hilton.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
